{"author":{"id":"00f627701a9269dee677db6aeaf21b9ca492295e9c85bdab1389f046efe9e77e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793270017,"nonce":"p3FE9Po2fzThugw/uAskAYQt1Ng=","title":"Phase 1: Lime core runtime, WebGPU swapchain, and offscreen snapshot harness","message":"Implement the Phase 1 foundation for PuffPuff as a standalone HashLink/Ash backend for OpenFL and HaxeFlixel:\n\n- `lime.app`: `Event\u003cT\u003e`, `Future\u003cT\u003e`, `Promise\u003cT\u003e` (backed by `ash-future`), `Module`, `Config`, and `Application` main loop.\n- `lime.ui`: `Window` (backed by `hlwindow`), `KeyCode`, `KeyModifier`, `MouseButton`, `MouseCursor`, and `MouseWheelMode`.\n- `puffpuff.gpu` \u0026 `lime.graphics`: `WgpuContext` (`hlwgpu` instance, adapter, device, queue, surface configuration, and offscreen pass support), `RenderContext`, and `Image`.\n- `lime.media`: `AudioBuffer` and `AudioSource` backed by `hlavi`.\n- `lime.math` \u0026 `lime.utils`: `Vector4` and `Matrix4` accelerated with `ash-simd`, plus zero-copy `ArrayBufferView`, `Float32Array`, `UInt8Array`, and `Log`.\n- `puffpuff.snapshot`: Offscreen WebGPU texture rendering, 256-byte aligned buffer readback, PNG encoder/decoder (`Png`, `Offscreen`, `Snapshot`), and `tools/snapshot/run.sh`.","files":null}]}